flowchart LR
    CONFIG[runtime bridge config] --> DIFF{compare catalog}
    CATALOG[(durable catalog)] --> DIFF
    DIFF -->|new| REGISTER[register]
    DIFF -->|same| RESTORE[restore]
    DIFF -->|changed| REPLACE[replace generation]
    DIFF -->|removed| STOP[stop durably]
    SHUTDOWN[runtime shutdown] --> SUSPEND[suspend processes]
    SUSPEND --> CATALOG
